        "02-compose/02-integrate": "[Rising] keep it shippable — merged, green, reviewed · producer: 01-build → consumer: 01-demo",
        "02-compose/03-enhance": "[Nurturing] improvements from stakeholder feedback into the cycle · producer: demo feedback → consumer: 01-build",
        "02-compose/04-maintain": "[Nurturing] defect fixes and technical debt, never starved · producer: incidents, retro actions → consumer: 01-build",
        "03-demonstrate/01-demo": "[Nurturing] the solution demonstrated — working software, to stakeholders · producer: 02-integrate → consumer: 02-accept",
        "03-demonstrate/02-accept": "[Nurturing] acceptance criteria verified, the sponsor approves · producer: 01-demo → consumer: 03-release",
        "03-demonstrate/03-release": "[Nurturing] cut the release · producer: 02-accept → consumer: 04-deploy",
        "03-demonstrate/04-deploy": "[Nurturing] into production · producer: 03-release → consumer: 04-govern/01-monitor",
        "04-govern/01-monitor": "[Nurturing] production tells the truth · producer: 04-deploy → consumer: 02-measure",
        "04-govern/02-measure": "[Leaving] outcomes against the business need — outcomes only, never person-scores · producer: 01-monitor → consumer: 03-retrospect",
        "04-govern/03-retrospect": "[Leaving] the lessons-learned round · producer: the whole team → consumer: 04-improve",
        "04-govern/04-improve": "[Leaving] improvement actions land here, each with an owner · producer: 03-retrospect → consumer: the next analysis cycle — the loop closes"
